        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela uleelede kuzibamba mumilongo yobile, nkokuti musanu acimwi mumulongo umwi aumwi, antafule iisalala kubusyu bwa-Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.6",
